n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.2\n- Reproducible in [3bfa50fd329cb9a7b01b0ab1cd7ac8f27f7391ac] (`master` on 21/05/2026)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta (3bfa50fd3) - macOS Tahoe (26.5.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M3 Max - Apple M3 Max (14 threads) - 36.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSame as reported in #110554 but for the fallback text server:\n\nWhen a font does not provide zero-width spaces, the fallback server puts a visible space in its place, but then fails to strip the advance and the rendering of that space down the line:\n\n| default driver | fallback driver |\n|--------------|----------------|\n| <img width=\"1720\" height=\"1410\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b9e5b38-2314-49be-abaf-20d04cf377e5\" /> | <img width=\"1720\" height=\"1410\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84f0c5e2-5e1a-46c0-a902-9c270d3db69c\" /> |\n\nThis bugfix for advanced text server in #111014 did not fix the issue for the fallback server as initially commented.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* build the engine/editor with `module_text_server_fb_enabled=\"yes\"`\n* make sure it is selected and applied (project config seems to win over command-line argument)\n* have a custom font without zero-width glyphs (as provided in the reproducer)\n* have a `Label` node with any text in it\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[reproducer-fallback-label-space.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28092131/reproducer-fallback-label-space.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119623/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119623/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}